   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHi Dr Akalin,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nIs there is an option in MethylKit to indicate that samples are paired? E<span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\">ach independent subject\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\">in the experiment received both treatments, i.e. the experiment was conducted\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\">to compare a  treatment with a control, and both the\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\">control and the treatment were administered to each of three samples.\r\n</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:130pt\" width=\"130\">\r\n<colgroup><col style=\"width:65pt\" width=\"65\" span=\"2\"></colgroup>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;font-weight:700;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);height:15.0pt;width:65pt\" width=\"65\" height=\"15\">\r\nSubject</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;font-weight:700;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);width:65pt\" width=\"65\">\r\nTreatment</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n1</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212)\">\r\nControl</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n1</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212)\">\r\nTreatment<span> </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n2</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212)\">\r\nControl</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n2</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212)\">\r\nTreatment<span> </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n3</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212)\">\r\nControl</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212);height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\r\n3</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding-top:1px;padding-right:1px;padding-left:1px;color:black;font-size:12pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;vertical-align:bottom;border:medium none;text-align:left;border:1px solid rgb(212,212,212)\">\r\nTreatment<span> </span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px\"><br>\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px\">Thank you,</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px\"><br>\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px\">Ali</span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15.5813px;font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15.5813px\"><br>\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<span></span>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,NotoColorEmoji,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;,&#39;Android Emoji&#39;,EmojiSymbols\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Alexandra Livernois, Ph.D. | Postdoctoral Fellow, Food from Thought</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif,Helvetica,EmojiFont,&#39;Apple Color Emoji&#39;,&#39;Segoe UI Emoji&#39;,NotoColorEmoji,&#39;Segoe UI Symbol&#39;,&#39;Android Emoji&#39;,EmojiSymbols\">\r\n<span>Department of Pathobiology, <span><span>University of Guelph</span> | Ontario, Canada</span></span></div>\r\n<span></span><span><a href=\"tel:(519)%20824-4120\" value=\"+15198244120\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">519-824-4120 Ext. 54655</a> | <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">live...@uoguelph.ca</a></span><span></span><span></span><br>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;font-size:14.7px;line-height:normal;font-family:Calibri;color:rgb(33,33,33)\">\r\n<span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px\"></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
